cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using this metadata. The Listen Signal name has not been screened and is provisional."
title: "Listen Signal: local-first media listening for Norwegian-language sources"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Erlingsen
    given-names: Ulrik
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-03
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/UlrikErlingsen/media-listening"
abstract: "An open, local-first application that counts brand and competitor mentions in Norwegian RSS/Atom feeds, with Bokmål/Nynorsk alias matching, local sentence-level sentiment (NorBERT3 or a lexicon fallback), share of voice, z-score spike flags, topic groups and a weekly brand pulse export."
keywords:
  - media monitoring
  - social listening
  - share of voice
  - norwegian
  - sentiment analysis
